{"id":"611993","name":"电饭锅豆角焖饭","author":"宸·羽","authorId":"7796837","desc":"","cover":"images/611993/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"四季豆","amount":"200g"},{"name":"腊肠","amount":"1根"}],"sub":[{"name":"香菇","amount":"5朵"},{"name":"蒜末","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"葱花","amount":"适量"},{"name":"虾米","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"电饭锅先煮上米饭。","img":"images/611993/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"接下准备配菜：四季豆、腊肠。","img":"images/611993/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切成粒。","img":"images/611993/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"配料：香菇丁、蒜末、香菜粒、葱花、虾米。","img":"images/611993/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"起锅热油，爆香蒜末。","img":"images/611993/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"香菇炒香。","img":"images/611993/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"腊肠和虾米倒入，炒出香气。","img":"images/611993/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"最后放入四季豆。","img":"images/611993/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"炒至变色，加适量的盐、酱油、胡椒粉调味，关火。","img":"images/611993/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"米饭距结束还有十分钟时开盖。","img":"images/611993/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"倒入炒好的配菜，盖上盖继续焖至时间结束。","img":"images/611993/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"最后加入葱花和香菜叶，再焖上一分钟。","img":"images/611993/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"开盖后翻拌均匀即可。","img":"images/611993/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/611993/step_14.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：电饭煲\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}